{"headword":"נְבֵלָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. carcass, corpse (</strong>as <em>inert, flabby</em><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:24\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.24\">1 K 13:24</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִבְלַת</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.29\">29</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְבֵלָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.19\">Is 26:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נִבְלָֽתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.26\">Dt 28:26</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:22\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.22\">1 K 13:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נִבְלָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:29\" href=\"/Joshua.8.29\">Jos 8:29</a> + 6 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">נִבְלָתָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:39\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.39\">Lv 11:39</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:40\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.40\">40</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נִבְלָתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.25\">Is 5:25</a> + 14 times;—<em>carcass, corpse:</em>"},{"senses":[{"senses":[{"definition":"human (not in Ez P, (H), which use <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּגֶר</span>); <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:29\" href=\"/Joshua.8.29\">Jos 8:29</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:22\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.22\">1 K 13:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:24\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.24\">24</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.25\">25</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:28\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.28\">28</a><sup>(×3)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.29\">29</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:30\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.30\">30</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:37\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.37\">2 K 9:37</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 26:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.26.23\">Je 26:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:30\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.30\">36:30</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.23\">Dt 21:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deu